                      (            os9.d):00127         *   can be used elsewheres later, in small routines with IRQ's turned off).
                      (            os9.d):00128         *
                      (            os9.d):00129         *        2019/10/30  Bill Nobel, from discussions with L. Curtis Boyle
                      (            os9.d):00130         * Added S$FS2Sig & S$KQ3Sig (both $80) FS2 & KQ3 (VRN) signal codes added (LCB).
