0093 335F             (s/basic09/gfx.asm):00143                             leau      -1,u                back up one
0095 6DC0             (s/basic09/gfx.asm):00144         skip@               tst       ,u+                 test the character
0097 2AFC             (s/basic09/gfx.asm):00145                             bpl       skip@               branch if hi bit not set (i.e. not $FF in table)
0099 20E9             (s/basic09/gfx.asm):00146                             bra       nextentry           go get next name
009B 6D5F             (s/basic09/gfx.asm):00147         equal@              tst       -1,u                test previous character
